{"id":"maravilloso","lemma":"maravilloso","pos":"adj","rank":665,"glosses":["wonderful, marvelous"],"ipa":"/maɾabiˈʝoso/","forms":{"feminine":"maravillosa","masculinePlural":"maravillosos","femininePlural":"maravillosas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ed/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-maravilloso.wav","examples":[{"text":"¡Eso es maravilloso!","en":"That's wonderful!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443572","words":[null,null,null],"phrases":[[0,2,"that's it"]]},{"text":"¡Qué idea maravillosa!","en":"What a wonderful idea!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/459524","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"idea"},null]},{"text":"Ustedes son maravillosos.","en":"They're wonderful.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448773","words":[{"g":"you all"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Ella me hizo un vestido maravilloso.","en":"She made me a nice dress.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/706965","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"dressed"},null]},{"text":"Se me ocurrió una maravillosa idea.","en":"A wonderful idea occurred to me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/38376","words":[{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to happen, to occur","l":"ocurrir"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"idea"}]}]}